  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "This is a forked package to apply a patch to fix a rare GC issue with the LibVLCSharp package on Android.\n      See the issue here: https://code.videolan.org/videolan/LibVLCSharp/-/work_items/659\n\n      alpha002: Lower Microsoft.WindowsAppSDK floor from 1.8.251106002 back to 1.7.260224002. The 1.8.x\n      line is incompatible with .NET MAUI 9.0.x (MSB3030: missing Microsoft.Maui HybridWebView.js), and\n      the 1.8 bump was incidental rather than an API requirement, so the floor blocked MAUI 9.0.x consumers.",
